{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "A Quiet Night at Home", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Let's Get Serious", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 13, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Showing That You Understand Someone's Feelings", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>You use a <span class=\"strong\">modal</span> like <span class=\"italic\">must</span>, <span class=\"italic\">would</span>, or <span class=\"italic\">could</span> followed by an adjective when you want to empathize with someone. When you empathize with someone, you show them that you understand their situation or feelings.</p>To talk about situations, use the <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> form of the adjective. <br/>To talk about feelings use the <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> form of the adjective.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here is the structure to follow:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "subject + modal + verb + adjective", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">He could be challenging to say the least.</span> (challenging situation)<br/><span class=\"italic\">I must be scared deep down!</span> (feel scared)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Don't forget to include the verb before the adjective.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Not having friends in a new place must be distressing!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I hoped it wouldn't be disappointing like my last relationship!", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking about Wishes and Imaginary Situations", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">wish</span> and the second conditional to talk about imaginary situations in the present or future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Wishes and sentences in the second conditional infer that what you want is probably not possible, or for some reason impossible.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Question</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What would I do if I didn't know you?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I don't know what I'd do if I didn't know you.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How would we work out our problems If we didn't know each other?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If we didn't know each other, we wouldn't have anyone to work out our problems with.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Might you consider marriage if you found someone you got along well with in the future?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If I found someone I got along well with in the future, I might consider marriage.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to work out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to solve", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You always help me work out my problems.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about your love life.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "teacake", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a sweet bun made with candied fruit and raisins", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Teacakes are great for a snack!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to get on with", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be compatible; to be like-minded", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm glad we got on well with each other!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "relieved", "type": "name"}, {"content": "happy something bad has not happened", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was relieved when we got on!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "comfort food", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the type of food you eat when you are sad or upset", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: When I'm feeling sick I prefer my favorite comfort foods.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Mr. Right", "type": "name"}, {"content": "The perfect man for you", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Will I ever meet Mr. Right?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to tolerate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to accept behavior that is not like your own", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Someday, I may meet someone I can actually tolerate.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "disappointing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not as good as you hoped for", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The film was really disappointing!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "challenging", "type": "name"}, {"content": "difficult to deal with", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He is a challenging person to get along with!", 